id: pm-brief-yanp
title: Replace the future-date empty-window fixture that blocks the PM 2026.10.25 toolchain CI
description: "Tracks gh:unbraind/pm-brief#193 (filed 2026-10-28, missed by the blind issue watch). test/coverage-gaps.test.ts:360 (and brief.test.ts since-fixtures) manufacture an empty activity window with the lower bound 2999-01-01; the host activity command rejects --from after --to with invalid_argument_value ('Activity --from must be before --to') once the dev toolchain moves to SDK 2026.10.25 or newer. Main still pins 2026.10.24 and is green, so the defect only surfaces on the pending toolchain bump PR (#192), whose four gates currently fail on it (latest run 41316901703). Fix by replacing the future-date fixture with a bounded past window (or an explicit empty-window construction the host accepts) without weakening the quiet-output assertions; then reland the toolchain update."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: ci,"gh:unbraind/pm-brief#192","gh:unbraind/pm-brief#193",toolchain
created_at: "2026-11-02T09:16:26.337Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-04T05:37:28.282Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-04T05:37:28.257Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-04T05:37:28.257Z"
author: pi-glm
resolution: Implemented and merged in #192 (a4f1197).
expected_result: The change described by this item is on main.
actual_result: "Merged in #192 as a4f1197; checks successful at head a579e73: CodeQL, audit-windows, codeql, enable-auto-merge, release-gate (bun), release-gate (npm), semgrep-cloud-platform/scan, test (22), test (26)."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-03T10:03:26.178Z",codex-toolchain-1103,"The bounded npm test run exposed the existing GH-193 fixture failure: brief since passed activity --from 2999-01-01 with implicit --to now, rejected as invalid_argument_value (Activity --from must be before --to). Root cause: pm-cli 2026.10.25 GH-1554 stable bounded activity window validation. Classification: test contract drift. Replace only this activity empty-window control with 1900-01-01 through 1900-01-02, before tracker history, retaining quiet ok=true and truncated=false assertions. Duplicate-list future since filters have no activity upper bound and remain valid empty-selection controls, so they are unchanged."
  "2026-11-03T10:06:07.092Z",codex-toolchain-1103,"The corrected bounded past-window test passes 1/1 directly (node --test --test-name-pattern=\"brief since requires a checkpoint\" test/coverage-gaps.test.ts), including until/text/slack outputs, quiet ok=true and truncated=false; it also passes through pm test. Typecheck, build:test and docstring pass after the fixture change. This is a test-only update; no activity admission behavior or duplicate since filters were changed. Leave open for coordinator verification."
